{"title":"Bogling","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 25 Bog that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 75 times (1.8% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/bogling\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/bogling?lv=25\">Lv 25 <span>2,473</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/bogling?lv=26\">Lv 26 <span>2,599</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/bogling?lv=27\">Lv 27 <span>2,694</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/bogling?lv=28\">Lv 28 <span>2,894</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/bogling?lv=29\">Lv 29 <span>336</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/bogling?lv=25\" title=\"Pick level 25\"><td><b>25</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>89</td><td>18.3</td><td>1,250</td><td class=\"muted\">267 · 25.6 · 3,750</td><td>2,473</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Trove\">Sunken Trove</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/bogling?lv=26\" title=\"Pick level 26\"><td><b>26</b></td><td>94</td><td>18.8</td><td>1,300</td><td class=\"muted\">282 · 26.3 · 3,900</td><td>2,599</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Trove\">Sunken Trove</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/bogling?lv=27\" title=\"Pick level 27\"><td><b>27</b></td><td>100</td><td>19.4</td><td>1,350</td><td class=\"muted\">300 · 27.2 · 4,050</td><td>2,694</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Trove\">Sunken Trove</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/bogling?lv=28\" title=\"Pick level 28\"><td><b>28</b></td><td>106</td><td>19.9</td><td>1,400</td><td class=\"muted\">318 · 27.9 · 4,200</td><td>2,894</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Trove\">Sunken Trove</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/bogling?lv=29\" title=\"Pick level 29\"><td><b>29</b></td><td>111</td><td>20.5</td><td>1,450</td><td class=\"muted\">333 · 28.7 · 4,350</td><td>336</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Trove\">Sunken Trove</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/26b781549a47239e8218.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Archer</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 25–44 · Werewolfpelt armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/c6b79e29faf1f957b127.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Acid)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 25–44 · Ogrewax armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/0510dbf5ad7b395e4494.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Warrior</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1,171 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"en